{
    "word": "netherworld",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                "word": "netherworld",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8facacc3-da90-463a-9a03-f7f976203c1f",
                        "entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "netherworlds"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2458e3e4-77a2-3103-a49b-60a059d76009",
                        "entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The place to which one's spirit descends upon death, conceived as below the surface of the earth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fc62acb-0595-46c2-83a4-e227997aeebf",
                                "sense_id": "2458e3e4-77a2-3103-a49b-60a059d76009",
                                "text": "In some religions, one's soul departs to a netherworld, instead of the heavens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc04c05b-75f6-4adf-aabe-5aae1f90f2a0",
                                "sense_id": "2458e3e4-77a2-3103-a49b-60a059d76009",
                                "text": "As Inanna prepares to descend she fastens the seven divine laws to her side, and as she walks toward the netherworld she speaks to her vizier, Ninshubur."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6370124b-fff8-338c-962c-93c576966847",
                        "entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The locale of the spirit world or afterlife, whether deemed to be situated below the world of the living or not."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a4f49bc-28dc-4b8c-bb50-90f7291c7bf0",
                                "sense_id": "6370124b-fff8-338c-962c-93c576966847",
                                "text": "While I was astrally projecting, I felt my soul pass through many insubstantial netherworlds."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "af13d2a6-23f2-3ced-bdd7-b327fbb0e4ce",
                        "entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Specifically, a location of punishment in the afterlife; a hell."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfc41447-b762-461d-a98d-68f27eb311af",
                                "sense_id": "af13d2a6-23f2-3ced-bdd7-b327fbb0e4ce",
                                "text": "The missionary was motivated by a sincere desire to rescue souls from eternal torment in the netherworld."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ad241b9-c390-31c0-a258-d9102470ec12",
                        "entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A hidden, shadowy, or sinister subculture, such as that of organized crime."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55cef768-888c-485d-9c62-c1cd882178b1",
                                "sense_id": "1ad241b9-c390-31c0-a258-d9102470ec12",
                                "text": "Richard had been initiated into the netherworld of dog racing by his father, and knew all the popular greyhound performance-enhancing drugs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d757b338-66c3-4b3c-941c-9a8ed5217f0a",
                                "sense_id": "1ad241b9-c390-31c0-a258-d9102470ec12",
                                "text": "Flicks is a large bar which has been in some conflict since it opened […] The nature of that conflict has been characterized as gay-straight, by the bar managers; as crazies-sane, by some residents; as predators-prey, by some bar patrons; and as \"netherworld\"-respectable, by some bureaucrats."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eee20d6a-3c72-4682-8e3e-65060d81359a",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "source_sense_description": "the spirit world",
                        "target_lang_word": "inframonde",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inframonde",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0c05f5b-850c-3536-966f-469e5f3d6366",
                                        "entry_id": "e99902a6-c23c-3e68-9851-40f230594d71",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Monde du dessous, souterrain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a237ebf8-a711-404e-abf9-e5d9c9d789aa",
                                                "sense_id": "d0c05f5b-850c-3536-966f-469e5f3d6366",
                                                "text": "À coté de l'équipe de campagne officielle de Valéry Giscard d'Estaing se monte une cellule parallèle où se retrouve cet inframonde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c531ce25-392e-47d5-becc-1b6c5a2654c3",
                                                "sense_id": "d0c05f5b-850c-3536-966f-469e5f3d6366",
                                                "text": "L’autre partie de l’inframonde s’avère moins macabre. C’est le domaine de Tlaloc, dieu de la terre et de la pluie, très ancienne divinité de la région, liée à la fertilité et au maïs, base de l’alimentation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "024cfff8-f1bb-47d6-9edd-b69a82990841",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "source_sense_description": "the spirit world",
                        "target_lang_word": "enfers",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enfers",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33f0a298-9693-34a2-8152-783de8cc0b14",
                                        "entry_id": "85162617-334e-3d4d-b667-8ea613563e79",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pluriel de enfer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8d72a90-5bea-488a-b840-640366288d6a",
                                                "sense_id": "33f0a298-9693-34a2-8152-783de8cc0b14",
                                                "text": "Ensuite, ne me restera plus qu'à subir le supplice des enfers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "494ab2d2-df48-4401-95b4-19293550025a",
                                                "sense_id": "33f0a298-9693-34a2-8152-783de8cc0b14",
                                                "text": "Il n'y a pas, par définition, de peine de mort possible dans les enfers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5d2b025-e00f-47e0-af92-dca7c2f61442",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "source_sense_description": "the spirit world",
                        "target_lang_word": "zaświaty",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zaświaty",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6a5e2d2-7829-3b54-b37d-17352e46589d",
                                        "entry_id": "baf13809-b507-3914-80fc-6888ddf26e47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "miejsce poza światem realnym, gdzie przebywają zmarli"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1a1563c-b8d2-4105-b5a3-bb56a7333c1b",
                                                "sense_id": "a6a5e2d2-7829-3b54-b37d-17352e46589d",
                                                "text": "U plemion rolniczych mieszkających na wschód od Missisipi zaświaty wyobrażane były jako kraina, w której wiecznie uprawia się kukurydzę"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0748565c-faf9-46ef-ac82-19cccb29a20e",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f31dff7-3834-3d6a-b9fd-a70de0ec193f",
                        "source_sense_description": "the spirit world",
                        "target_lang_word": "преиспо́дняя",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "преиспо́дняя",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2dc746a-315f-3c47-a4c8-4150bbf4d891",
                                        "entry_id": "ba4de81f-87ad-3dd6-898b-e47cca99ee5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "религ. в ряде религий — место, где после смерти грешников их души подвергаются вечным мукам; ад, геенна"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bd152a5-1ab7-4dbb-be8f-beb67654c75e",
                                                "sense_id": "f2dc746a-315f-3c47-a4c8-4150bbf4d891",
                                                "text": "Ты помнишь, Филипп, когда ты приехал, всего две недели назад… помнишь, как я тебя встретил, какие планы составлял, помнишь? а теперь… теперь все это рухнуло, брат, все это провалилось сквозь землю, в самую преисподнюю — ко дну, брат, все пошло, и я сижу, как дурак, думаю, и ничего не придумаю."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d192595-d351-4c2e-bfbc-6aab1c4135a0",
                                                "sense_id": "f2dc746a-315f-3c47-a4c8-4150bbf4d891",
                                                "text": "Расступилася вдруг под нею мать сыра-земля, и разверзлася вся преисподняя огненная."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
